Ask "House price?" and call the answer price.
Ask "Deposit?" and call the answer deposit.
Ask "Interest rate for year in percent?" and call the answer interest rate.
Ask "Number of year?" and call the answer years.
Let loan be price minus deposit.
Let monthly rate be interest rate divide 100 divide 12.
Let number of month be years multiply 12.
Let payment be loan multiply monthly rate divide (1 minus (1 plus monthly rate) power minus number of month).
Let payment be round payment to 2 decimal.
Say loan.
Say payment.
Let total be payment multiply number of month.
Say total.
